        "d": "To celebrate dancing, movement, and percolating, I have dug deep into the vault for grooves that will get you moving. As a warm, sweaty summer begins to fade, this mix brings the heat, featuring selections from Kenny Dope, May Ervin, Mike Grant, Dubtribe, MK, and more.",
